    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> Each coding must be associated with a file\nextension via <a href=\"#registerExtension(java.lang.String,java.lang.String)\"><code>registerExtension(String, String)</code></a> or <a href=\"#setExtensions(java.util.Map)\"><code>setExtensions(Map)</code></a>. Also,\ncustomizations to the list of codings here should be matched by\ncustomizations to the same list in <a href=\"CachingResourceResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.resource\"><code>CachingResourceResolver</code></a> to\nensure encoded variants of a resource are cached under separate keys.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 每个编码必须通过 <a href=\"#registerExtension(java.lang.String,java.lang.String)\"><code>registerExtension(String, String)</code></a> 或 <a href=\"#setExtensions(java.util.Map)\"><code>setExtensions(Map)</code></a> 与文件扩展名关联。此外，此处对编码列表的自定义必须与 <a href=\"CachingResourceResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.resource\"><code>CachingResourceResolver</code></a> 中的相同列表进行匹配，以确保资源的编码变体在单独的键下缓存。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that this resolver must be ordered ahead of a\n<a href=\"VersionResourceResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.resource\"><code>VersionResourceResolver</code></a> with a content-based, version strategy to\nensure the version calculation is not impacted by the encoding.",
      "translation": "注意，此解析器必须位于带有基于内容的版本策略的<a href=\"VersionResourceResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.resource\"><code>VersionResourceResolver</code></a>之前，以确保版本计算不受编码影响。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Java config friendly alternative to <a href=\"#setExtensions(java.util.Map)\"><code>setExtensions(Map)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"#setExtensions(java.util.Map)\">`setExtensions(Map)`</a> 的 Java 配置友好替代方案。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default content codings.",
