    {
      "source": "The list of supported <a href=\"#setContentCodings(java.util.List)\"><code>contentCodings</code></a> can\nbe configured, in order of preference, and each coding must be associated\nwith <a href=\"#setExtensions(java.util.Map)\"><code>extensions</code></a>.",
